  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_014 (0.725 accuracy) and config_036 (0.7207) are top performers using scvi_n200 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoders with transformer aggregation. This experiment tests pca_n2000 RNA with the same image encoder and transformer aggregation but concat fusion, which could clarify if RNA encoder choice (pca_n2000 vs scvi_n200) impacts performance. It balances exploration of RNA encoder alternatives while reusing effective components (transformer aggregation, imagenet_vit_l). Expected cost is ~3.6 GPU hours, similar to config_014."
}

